From: SteveDeFacto <5148995+SteveDeFacto@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 22:20:24 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 2/4] holder: strict launcher/config/render for a private stock
 base rpc state holder

Pinned flag manifest (FLAGS.json, file:line + sha256 from base/base 5476069f and base/reth 7134be3b),
validated config (loopback RPC, no verifier port, closed child env incl. L1 trust off, no implicit
sequencer, HDD-backed origin image, optional writethrough dm-cache within the 250,000,000,000-byte
aggregate NVMe cap), systemd units, root-only storage script and cache drill, supervisor with
process-group ownership, PDEATHSIG, sd_notify readiness and bounded stop. Tests: validation,
render, real sysfs placement, B URL policy, stand-in lifecycle, upstream reth --dev lifecycle,
8 mutation controls. Snapshot size tool and evidence; RESULT.md corrections.
